ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Sfumato
Board: /styles/sfumato
Companions: sfumato-starter.html, sfumato-study.ai, sfumato-study.psd

Artboards
1. Portrait study, 2400 × 3000 px. One invented head. No contour stroke. Edge made only of stacked transparent gradients.
2. Comparison, same size. Left: the same head with a 2 px outline. Right: the sfumato version. Label both in a plain sans.

Palette
Warm ground #1a120c. Flesh built from #c4a484, #8d6b58, #efe3c8. Shadow #3a2a22. Distance #6e7c74.

Rules
- No stroke on the form.
- Opacity builds in thin layers, about 8–15%, softer at the boundary than at the center.
- Ground meets the form in a gradient, not a cutout.
- Do not reproduce any existing painting. Invent the head.
